positions.description:
• Key contributor to a legacy C#/.NET and JavaScript quoting & issuing application for insurance policies;
implemented test cases, refactored legacy modules, and added new features. Built CI/CD
with Bamboo and GitHub Actions.

• Built data solutions in Python and SQL; created Flyway migrations for aerial pricing configurations;
developed mainframe integration for policy data storage and internal tools for mainframe data visualization.

• Mentored interns and served as one of the lead developer on a SOAP-to-REST API migration for the Policy Servicing Tool providing PR reviews and feedback, delivering a new policy deletion endpoint with proper security and auditing.

